
1. Install [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/).

2. Copy the following lines of text and save them as a file `package.json` inside your folder.

```json
{
  "type": "module",
  "dependencies": {
    "@azure-rest/ai-inference": "latest",
    "@azure/core-auth": "latest",
    "@azure/core-sse": "latest"
  }
}
```

> Note: `@azure/core-sse` is only needed when you stream the chat completions response.

3. Open a terminal window in this folder and run `npm install`.

4. For each of the code snippets below, copy the content into a file `sample.js` and run with `node sample.js`.
